uding the pupil\'s details, previous school and results, and parent or guardian contacts</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">To let the school process the application</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Website visitors, demo and contact requests</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Name, email, phone number, school, district and the message you send us</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">To reply to you and arrange a demo</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Everyone who signs in</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Sign-in, verification and reset codes (stored in hashed form and short-lived), IP address of sign-ins, and a record of important actions for security</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">To keep accounts secure and investigate misuse</td></tr></tbody></table>We do not ask for or keep national identification numbers of parents, parents\' income, ethnicity or tribe. We do not sell personal information, and we do not use pupils\' information for advertising.',

